    risks: "Risks include pain, bleeding, infection, fever, low oxygen, arrhythmia, persistent air leak, pneumothorax after drain removal, subcutaneous emphysema, failure of lung re-expansion, non-diagnostic tissue and tumour seeding at a tract. Sedation-related respiratory deterioration and rare severe haemorrhage or organ injury require rescue capability.",
