    risks: "Bleeding is the main biopsy-specific risk, alongside hypoxaemia, bronchospasm, arrhythmia, infection, sedative reaction and non-diagnostic tissue. Airway obstruction from clot, major haemorrhage, respiratory failure or pneumothorax from an unintended deep biopsy is uncommon but requires urgent support.",
